	// | `jwt` | `Authorization: Bearer <jwt>` on every request, the daemon carrying the sandbox's requests as HTTP; the broker is any HTTP server, behind any proxy |
	//
	// The token is ES256, signed with the key of the very certificate
	// `certificate` would present, which it carries in `x5c`, for `aud`
